Package: uzunyx-terminal
Version: @VERSION@
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: zsh, starship, atuin, zsh-syntax-highlighting, fonts-nerd-symbols, fastfetch, imagemagick, git
Recommends: uzunyx-lookandfeel
Description: Uzunyx terminal: zsh, Oh My Zsh, Starship and fastfetch
 Configuration used by the Uzunyx Konsole profiles: zsh with a pinned copy of
 Oh My Zsh and zsh-autocomplete, a Powerline-style Starship prompt in the
 colours of each edition, syntax highlighting, and fastfetch showing Uzunyx
 with its ASCII logo. The login shell of the user is not changed.
